back (for prostration) till the Prophet (ﷺ) prostrated and then we would prostrate after him.";Sahih al-Bukhari 690, Book 10, Hadith 84;;question #1;What does this narration teach about the importance of following the actions of the Prophet (ﷺ) during prayer?
