not on us."" I then looked at the clouds to see them separating forming a sort of a crown round Medina.";Sahih al-Bukhari 3582, Book 61, Hadith 91;;question #1;How did the Prophet Muhammad (ﷺ) respond to the request for rain during a drought in Medina?
"The Prophet (ﷺ) used to deliver his sermons while standing beside a trunk of a datepalm. When he had the 
