embracing Islam.";Sahih al-Bukhari 4322, Book 64, Hadith 352;;question #1;What is the significance of providing proof in claiming spoils of war in Islamic tradition?
"When the Prophet (ﷺ) had finished from the battle of Hunain, he sent Abu Amir at the head of an army to 
