Musa (i.e. `Abdullah bin Qais).";Sahih al-Bukhari 4323, Book 64, Hadith 353;;question #1;What actions did the Prophet Muhammad (ﷺ) take to honor and pray for his companions after a battle?
"The Prophet (ﷺ) came to me while there was an effeminate man sitting with me, and I heard him (i.e. the 
