did. I asked (her), ""Does my father know about it?"" She said, ""yes"" I asked, Does Allah's Messenger (ﷺ) 
know about it too?"" She said, ""Yes, Allah's Messenger (ﷺ) does too."" So the tears filled my eyes and I wept. 
