"The Prophet (ﷺ) said, ""Straighten your rows, for I see you from behind my back.'";Sahih al-Bukhari 718, Book 10, Hadith 113;;question #2;How does the Prophet Muhammad (ﷺ) emphasize the importance of maintaining order in congregational prayers?
