by the well, half of an Ushr (i.e. one-twentieth) is compulsory (as Zakat on the yield of the land).""";Sahih al-Bukhari 1483, Book 24, Hadith 83;;question #2;How does the method of irrigation affect the amount of zakat due on agricultural produce?
"The Prophet (ﷺ) said, ""There is no Zakat on less than five Awsuq (of dates), or on less than five camels, or 
