means that they become red .""";Sahih al-Bukhari 1488, Book 24, Hadith 88;;question #2;What are the implications of selling unripe fruits in the context of Islamic commerce?
"`Umar bin Al-Khattab gave a horse in charity in Allah's Cause and later he saw it being sold in the 
