     his money.""";Sahih al-Bukhari 1498, Book 24, Hadith 98;;question #2;How does the story illustrate the concept of fulfilling one's obligations even in difficult circumstances?
"Allah's Messenger (ﷺ) said, ""There is no compensation for one killed or wounded by an animal or by falling 
