kept on doing that till Allah caused him to be killed at Badr.";Sahih al-Bukhari 3950, Book 64, Hadith 2;;question #2;How did Abu Jahl's confrontation with Sa'd bin Mu'adh highlight the tensions between Muslims and non-Muslims in Mecca?
