hunger.""";Sahih al-Bukhari 4101, Book 64, Hadith 145;;question #2;How did the Prophet (ﷺ) demonstrate trust in Allah's provision during times of scarcity?
"When the Trench was dug, I saw the Prophet (ﷺ) in the state of severe hunger. So I returned to my wife 
