"Allah's Messenger (ﷺ) said, ""If you knew that which I know you would laugh little and weep much.""";Sahih al-Bukhari 6485, Book 81, Hadith 74;;question #2;How does awareness of certain realities influence a person's tendency to laugh or weep?
"The Prophet (ﷺ) said, ""If you knew that which I know, you would laugh little and weep much.""";Sahih al-Bukhari 6486, Book 81, Hadith 75;;question #2;How does awareness of certain realities influence a person's perspective on life?
"Allah's Messenger (ﷺ) said, ""The (Hell) Fire is surrounded by all kinds of desires and passions, while 
