"Allah's Messenger (ﷺ) said, ""I have been sent and the Hour (is at hand) as these two (fingers).";Sahih al-Bukhari 6504, Book 81, Hadith 93;;question #2;How does the comparison of two fingers illustrate the closeness of the Hour?
"The Prophet (ﷺ) said, ""I have been sent and the Hour (is at hand) as these two (fingers).";Sahih al-Bukhari 6505, Book 81, Hadith 94;;question #2;How does the comparison of two fingers illustrate the closeness of the Day of Judgment?
"Allah's Messenger (ﷺ) said, ""The Hour will not be established till the sun rises from the west, and when it 
