"The Prophet (ﷺ) said, ""Relieved or relieving. And a believer is relieved (by death).";Sahih al-Bukhari 6513, Book 81, Hadith 102;;question #2;How does death serve as a form of relief for a believer according to Islamic teachings?
"Allah's Messenger (ﷺ) said, ""When carried to his grave, a dead person is followed by three, two of which 
