unconscious.""";Sahih al-Bukhari 6518, Book 81, Hadith 107;;question #2;What is the role of Prophet Moses in the events of the Day of Resurrection according to Islamic teachings?
"The Prophet (ﷺ) said, ""Allah will take the whole earth (in His Hand) and will roll up the Heaven in His 
