hunger.""";Sahih al-Bukhari 4101, Book 64, Hadith 145;;question #3;What role did the Prophet (ﷺ) play in ensuring that all his companions were fed during the trench incident?
"When the Trench was dug, I saw the Prophet (ﷺ) in the state of severe hunger. So I returned to my wife 
