only for necks.""";Sahih al-Bukhari 7017, Book 91, Hadith 34;;question #3;How do dreams symbolize one's adherence to religion according to Islamic beliefs?
"Um Al-`Ala an Ansari woman who had given the Pledge of allegiance to Allah's Messenger (ﷺ) said, 
